11
00:00:31,181 --> 00:00:34,640
One-Click, Promo Studio, and WhatsApp for kiranas.

12
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:38,089
In India, festivals decide India's retail year.

13
00:00:38,243 --> 00:00:40,366
12 windows in six months.

14
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,596
Each a pricing decision for every product in every single city.

15
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:49,564
59% of consumer-goods trade promotions lose money.

16
00:00:49,718 --> 00:00:54,241
And India's 12 million kirana stores have no single planner at all.

17
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,083
Let's plan for Diwali.

18
00:00:56,237 --> 00:01:00,975
Our budget, goal, dates and city lifts fill themselves in.

19
00:01:01,129 --> 00:01:06,392
Drop in whatever the team has: a policy PDF, a shelf-tag photo, a WhatsApp scheme,

20
00:01:06,546 --> 00:01:11,762
