29
00:01:37,124 --> 00:01:41,304
₹8,102 more than a flat 10% off would have given.

30
00:01:41,458 --> 00:01:46,734
And the badge: confidence 90%, 181 of 181 checks passed.

31
00:01:47,033 --> 00:01:55,119
Offers by product and city, a calendar, copy in English and Hindi, every line checked for honest wording.

32
00:01:55,273 --> 00:01:57,029
Nothing goes live without a person.

33
00:01:57,183 --> 00:02:03,016
Above ₹15,000 of worst case, a senior's go-ahead is recorded with this version of the plan.

34
00:02:03,316 --> 00:02:05,612
Our WhatsApp AI agent is live.

35
00:02:05,766 --> 00:02:08,216
A kirana owner can message our WhatsApp number.

36
00:02:08,370 --> 00:02:13,715
The join code is typed in for them. They send an offer, a festival, or a price-tag photo.

37
00:02:13,869 --> 00:02:15,771
Above MRP? Refused.

38
00:02:15,926 --> 00:02:17,965
Promo review within 60 seconds.

39
00:02:18,119 --> 00:02:19,626
No app, no login required.

40
00:02:19,926 --> 00:02:23,017
For detailed promo planning, we have Promo Studio.

41
00:02:23,172 --> 00:02:24,695
Customise everything.

42
00:02:24,849 --> 00:02:27,487
Write the brief in plain English or Hinglish.

43
00:02:27,642 --> 00:02:31,392
It's compiled into exact constraints, read back before anything runs.

44
00:02:31,546 --> 00:02:37,540
Set the budget, the discount cap, the margin floor, cities, categories, mechanisms, days.

45
00:02:37,694 --> 00:02:40,695
Open each offer's checks, approve with sign-off tiers.

46
00:02:40,849 --> 00:02:43,027
Replan live, ask what-ifs.

47
00:02:43,327 --> 00:02:45,228
It is powered by agentic AI.

48
00:02:45,382 --> 00:02:48,464
The agent chooses each tool and logs why.

49
00:02:48,618 --> 00:02:51,222
Eight model calls take just about one cent.

50
00:02:51,521 --> 00:02:55,597
Evidence gets two reads, the model and OCR, that must agree.

51
00:02:55,751 --> 00:02:57,653
And doubts go to a person.

52
00:02:57,807 --> 00:03:03,288
HQ cuts the budget mid-festival? It replans and shows the difference.

53
00:03:03,588 --> 00:03:08,196
We have all nine key features from the case brief, running end to end:

54
00:03:08,350 --> 00:03:18,302
product selection, mechanism, depth and timing, cannibalisation, relationships, stock and expiry, city-level plans, competitor awareness, and test before launch.

55
00:03:18,601 --> 00:03:23,706
ShubhLabh's Intelli AI is our own in-house AI agent that rechecks every calculation in the background:

56
00:03:23,861 --> 00:03:29,805
MRP, honest percent off, margin, break-even, budget. And it gives a confidence score once it's sure.

57
00:03:30,104 --> 00:03:32,553
We deliver proof, not promises.

58
00:03:32,707 --> 00:03:41,232
Price response calibrated on 4.85 million real retail records. A 62% smaller loss than a flat discount, in a real-data back-test.

59
00:03:41,386 --> 00:03:44,027
190 of 190 red-team attacks caught.

60
00:03:44,326 --> 00:03:50,582
Every festival offer designed by AI, verified by ShubhLabh's Intelli AI, and approved by humans.

61
00:03:50,736 --> 00:03:53,700
ShubhLabh AI. Ab sirf laabh hi laabh.

